<opsproc code="00008830.0008001" revdate="2018-11-15T11:16:06"><title>Lavatory and Galley Extraction Fan</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.004"><title>General Information</title><procbody lid="N.00008830.0008001.005"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.006"><para code="00008830.0008001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.007">Two amber crosses replace the
cabin zone temperature indications on the <tech-label type="s-page">COND</tech-label>.</para><para code="00008830.0008001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.008"><duref product="MMEL" ref="00007521"/></para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.009"><para code="00008830.0008001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.010"> The INOP SYS column on the <tech-label type="s-page">STATUS</tech-label> may display the <emph bold="false" color="Amber" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="false">LAV DET</emph> message.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.011"><para code="00008830.0008001.005" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.012">The cabin zone temperature
regulation is lost.</para><para code="00008830.0008001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.013">The Air
Conditioning System Controller commands <abb>FWD</abb> and
AFT cabin ducts temperature using the position of the <tech-label type="sel">FWD CABIN</tech-label> and the <tech-label type="sel">AFT CABIN</tech-label> on the AIR COND overhead panel.</para><para code="00008830.0008001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.014">Slight effect on cabin comfort may occur.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.015"><para code="00008830.0008001.008" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.016">The cockpit temperature regulation is still operative.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.021"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00008830.0008001.022"><action-block lid="N.00008830.0008001.017"><title>Deactivation of the GSM On Board:</title><action layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.018" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008830.0008001.009"><challenge><tech-label type="sw">GSM MAIN POWER</tech-label> in the hat rack</challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.019" memory="false"><command code="00008830.0008001.010"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.020">Inform the cabin crew
that the GSM On Board system is not available.</para></command></action></action-block><action-block lid="N.00008830.0008001.023"><title>Deactivation of the Lavatory and Galley Extraction Fan</title><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.024"><para code="00008830.0008001.011" layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.025">In the case of continuous operation of the lavatory and galley extraction
fan, or in the case of "burning smell" associated with the
inoperative lavatory and galley extraction fan:</para></inform><action layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.026" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008830.0008001.012"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">AIR COND/LAV/GALLEY VENT
CTL/EXTRACT FAN/CTL (122VU U21)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008830.0008001.027" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008830.0008001.013"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">AIR COND/LAV/GALLEY VENT
CTL/EXTRACT FAN/SPLY (122VU U19)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action></action></action-block></procbody></procitem></opsproc>